{"cast":"velvet","group":"game","bank":"game.574b300572.bin","lines":[{"id":"game.intro.ones.01","moment":"game.intro.ones","text":"Ones on the Rooftop. First to eleven, make it, take it. The city has the best seats.","off":0,"len":26938,"sec":5.225},{"id":"game.intro.ones.02","moment":"game.intro.ones","text":"One on one, After Hours style. First to eleven. Score and you keep the ball.","off":26938,"len":25575,"sec":4.854},{"id":"game.intro.threes.01","moment":"game.intro.threes","text":"Threes on the Rooftop. First to twenty-one, ninety seconds on the clock. Pass it like a secret.","off":52513,"len":30292,"sec":5.734},{"id":"game.intro.threes.02","moment":"game.intro.threes","text":"Three on three under the string lights. Twenty-one wins, ninety-second clock. Play together.","off":82805,"len":28107,"sec":5.316},{"id":"game.check.01","moment":"game.check","text":"Their ball. Quiet feet.","off":110912,"len":10702,"sec":1.358},{"id":"game.check.02","moment":"game.check","text":"Checked. Stay in step.","off":121614,"len":9937,"sec":1.169},{"id":"game.check.03","moment":"game.check","text":"Shadow them. All night.","off":131551,"len":10491,"sec":1.314},{"id":"game.check.04","moment":"game.check","text":"Ball's theirs. Make it uncomfortable.","off":142042,"len":14091,"sec":2.075},{"id":"game.make.01","moment":"game.make","text":"Smooth jumper.","off":156133,"len":9160,"sec":0.981},{"id":"game.make.02","moment":"game.make","text":"Soft touch. Nice.","off":165293,"len":11224,"sec":1.437},{"id":"game.make.03","moment":"game.make","text":"That's a two.","off":176517,"len":8395,"sec":0.822},{"id":"game.make.04","moment":"game.make","text":"Pull-up, pure.","off":184912,"len":8120,"sec":0.861},{"id":"game.make.05","moment":"game.make","text":"Right on the beat.","off":193032,"len":9096,"sec":0.923},{"id":"game.make.06","moment":"game.make","text":"Mid-range, midnight.","off":202128,"len":9939,"sec":1.104},{"id":"game.three.01","moment":"game.three","text":"From way out there!","off":212067,"len":8877,"sec":0.995},{"id":"game.three.02","moment":"game.three","text":"Three. Cool as the night.","off":220944,"len":10856,"sec":1.324},{"id":"game.three.03","moment":"game.three","text":"Deep one. Very deep.","off":231800,"len":10851,"sec":1.364},{"id":"game.three.04","moment":"game.three","text":"That's three. Don't wait up.","off":242651,"len":10960,"sec":1.385},{"id":"game.three.05","moment":"game.three","text":"Long range, no problem.","off":253611,"len":11106,"sec":1.416},{"id":"game.layup.01","moment":"game.layup","text":"Soft finish. Lovely.","off":264717,"len":11862,"sec":1.587},{"id":"game.layup.02","moment":"game.layup","text":"Like a whisper.","off":276579,"len":8514,"sec":0.859},{"id":"game.layup.03","moment":"game.layup","text":"Tasteful finish.","off":285093,"len":8949,"sec":1.013},{"id":"game.layup.04","moment":"game.layup","text":"Easy two. Quiet two.","off":294042,"len":11253,"sec":1.452},{"id":"game.dunk.01","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Oh, nobody's sleeping now!","off":305295,"len":11052,"sec":1.435},{"id":"game.dunk.02","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Rim just rang!","off":316347,"len":9109,"sec":0.978},{"id":"game.dunk.03","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Now that's loud!","off":325456,"len":9120,"sec":0.934},{"id":"game.dunk.04","moment":"game.dunk","text":"The skyline saw that!","off":334576,"len":10156,"sec":1.215},{"id":"game.dunk.05","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Flushed it! Lights up!","off":344732,"len":10074,"sec":1.153},{"id":"game.poster.01","moment":"game.poster","text":"Oh! Posterized! Hang it downtown!","off":354806,"len":13970,"sec":2.048},{"id":"game.poster.02","moment":"game.poster","text":"On the defender! Gallery piece!","off":368776,"len":12388,"sec":1.757},{"id":"game.poster.03","moment":"game.poster","text":"Whoa! Put that on a billboard!","off":381164,"len":11721,"sec":1.542},{"id":"game.poster.04","moment":"game.poster","text":"Somebody get that defender a blanket!","off":392885,"len":13575,"sec":1.979},{"id":"game.poster.05","moment":"game.poster","text":"The city will talk about that!","off":406460,"len":11267,"sec":1.438},{"id":"game.poster.06","moment":"game.poster","text":"Up and over! Gorgeous!","off":417727,"len":11434,"sec":1.515},{"id":"game.andone.01","moment":"game.andone","text":"And one. Unbothered.","off":429161,"len":10315,"sec":1.292},{"id":"game.andone.02","moment":"game.andone","text":"Plus the foul. Greedy.","off":439476,"len":11719,"sec":1.569},{"id":"game.andone.03","moment":"game.andone","text":"Contact? Didn't matter.","off":451195,"len":11143,"sec":1.479},{"id":"game.andone.04","moment":"game.andone","text":"Bonus track.","off":462338,"len":8464,"sec":0.867},{"id":"game.miss.01","moment":"game.miss","text":"Off the iron.","off":470802,"len":8068,"sec":0.819},{"id":"game.miss.02","moment":"game.miss","text":"Wrong key.","off":478870,"len":8267,"sec":0.736},{"id":"game.miss.03","moment":"game.miss","text":"Close, not quite.","off":487137,"len":9532,"sec":1.067},{"id":"game.miss.04","moment":"game.miss","text":"Missed. Next one.","off":496669,"len":10030,"sec":1.171},{"id":"game.airball.01","moment":"game.airball","text":"Airball. Pigeons looked away.","off":506699,"len":12637,"sec":1.731},{"id":"game.airball.02","moment":"game.airball","text":"Radio silence. Nothing hit.","off":519336,"len":13410,"sec":2.054},{"id":"game.airball.03","moment":"game.airball","text":"Still falling somewhere downtown.","off":532746,"len":11886,"sec":1.61},{"id":"game.airball.04","moment":"game.airball","text":"Ooh. Nothing but night air.","off":544632,"len":10447,"sec":1.244},{"id":"game.block.01","moment":"game.block","text":"Denied. Politely.","off":555079,"len":9918,"sec":1.139},{"id":"game.block.02","moment":"game.block","text":"Rejected! Back to sender!","off":564997,"len":11770,"sec":1.607},{"id":"game.block.03","moment":"game.block","text":"Sent it twenty floors down!","off":576767,"len":11401,"sec":1.48},{"id":"game.block.04","moment":"game.block","text":"Right into the skyline!","off":588168,"len":10136,"sec":1.211},{"id":"game.block.05","moment":"game.block","text":"Absolutely not. Next.","off":598304,"len":11498,"sec":1.531},{"id":"game.block.06","moment":"game.block","text":"Blocked it, cool as anything.","off":609802,"len":11500,"sec":1.494},{"id":"game.blocked.01","moment":"game.blocked","text":"Sent back. Ouch.","off":621302,"len":9844,"sec":1.156},{"id":"game.blocked.02","moment":"game.blocked","text":"Turned away. Try the fake.","off":631146,"len":10985,"sec":1.411},{"id":"game.blocked.03","moment":"game.blocked","text":"Defender got a piece.","off":642131,"len":9881,"sec":1.152},{"id":"game.blocked.04","moment":"game.blocked","text":"Bouncer said no.","off":652012,"len":9209,"sec":1.011},{"id":"game.steal.01","moment":"game.steal","text":"Picked the pocket!","off":661221,"len":9222,"sec":0.962},{"id":"game.steal.02","moment":"game.steal","text":"Too quick! Yours now.","off":670443,"len":10640,"sec":1.328},{"id":"game.steal.03","moment":"game.steal","text":"Swiped it, quietly.","off":681083,"len":10029,"sec":1.184},{"id":"game.steal.04","moment":"game.steal","text":"Taken, no questions.","off":691112,"len":10407,"sec":1.268},{"id":"game.steal.05","moment":"game.steal","text":"Lifted. Nobody heard a thing.","off":701519,"len":12451,"sec":1.693},{"id":"game.stolen.01","moment":"game.stolen","text":"Oh, they took it.","off":713970,"len":8944,"sec":0.916},{"id":"game.stolen.02","moment":"game.stolen","text":"Slipped away. Stay calm.","off":722914,"len":12015,"sec":1.607},{"id":"game.stolen.03","moment":"game.stolen","text":"Lost it. That stings.","off":734929,"len":10450,"sec":1.275},{"id":"game.stolen.04","moment":"game.stolen","text":"Gone. Get it back.","off":745379,"len":9105,"sec":1.032},{"id":"game.ankles.01","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Ankles took the elevator!","off":754484,"len":10585,"sec":1.314},{"id":"game.ankles.02","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Defender's on the floor!","off":765069,"len":9995,"sec":1.22},{"id":"game.ankles.03","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Whoa! Crossed up and cooked!","off":775064,"len":10714,"sec":1.272},{"id":"game.ankles.04","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Take a minute, defender.","off":785778,"len":10015,"sec":1.203},{"id":"game.ankles.05","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Static on that defender!","off":795793,"len":10533,"sec":1.287},{"id":"game.ankles.06","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Oh, that crossover was rude.","off":806326,"len":11826,"sec":1.524},{"id":"game.bite.01","moment":"game.bite","text":"They bit. Sweet.","off":818152,"len":9502,"sec":1.058},{"id":"game.bite.02","moment":"game.bite","text":"Fooled the defender.","off":827654,"len":9392,"sec":1.04},{"id":"game.bite.03","moment":"game.bite","text":"Hook caught them.","off":837046,"len":8881,"sec":0.902},{"id":"game.bite.04","moment":"game.bite","text":"Sold the fake. Sold out.","off":845927,"len":11591,"sec":1.515},{"id":"game.foul.01","moment":"game.foul","text":"Needle off the record.","off":857518,"len":9897,"sec":1.146},{"id":"game.foul.02","moment":"game.foul","text":"Somebody's in trouble.","off":867415,"len":10060,"sec":1.167},{"id":"game.foul.03","moment":"game.foul","text":"Referee's got something.","off":877475,"len":10704,"sec":1.301},{"id":"game.foul.04","moment":"game.foul","text":"Pause the music.","off":888179,"len":8779,"sec":0.961},{"id":"game.rival.make.01","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"They answer. Fine.","off":896958,"len":10487,"sec":1.25},{"id":"game.rival.make.02","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"Cute. Now show them.","off":907445,"len":9746,"sec":1.19},{"id":"game.rival.make.03","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"Their verse. Now yours.","off":917191,"len":11375,"sec":1.528},{"id":"game.rival.make.04","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"That fell for them.","off":928566,"len":8791,"sec":0.95},{"id":"game.rival.make.05","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"Well, that went in.","off":937357,"len":9087,"sec":0.948},{"id":"game.rival.dunk.01","moment":"game.rival.dunk","text":"Oh, they wanted the spotlight.","off":946444,"len":11340,"sec":1.441},{"id":"game.rival.dunk.02","moment":"game.rival.dunk","text":"Heavy bass on that one.","off":957784,"len":10752,"sec":1.309},{"id":"game.rival.dunk.03","moment":"game.rival.dunk","text":"Ooh. That one's getting replayed.","off":968536,"len":11546,"sec":1.507},{"id":"game.rival.dunk.04","moment":"game.rival.dunk","text":"They flushed it. Answer back.","off":980082,"len":11808,"sec":1.616},{"id":"game.run.01","moment":"game.run","text":"That's a run. The other side went quiet.","off":991890,"len":14460,"sec":2.192},{"id":"game.run.02","moment":"game.run","text":"Unanswered, all of it. The city's humming.","off":1006350,"len":14168,"sec":2.167},{"id":"game.run.03","moment":"game.run","text":"On a run. Don't let the music stop.","off":1020518,"len":13543,"sec":2.001},{"id":"game.run.04","moment":"game.run","text":"Another, and another. The city loves a streak.","off":1034061,"len":15841,"sec":2.528},{"id":"game.point.us.01","moment":"game.point","text":"Game point. One more, and we say goodnight.","tags":["side:us"],"off":1049902,"len":16098,"sec":2.471},{"id":"game.point.them.01","moment":"game.point","text":"They're one away. Make it awkward.","tags":["side:them"],"off":1066000,"len":12584,"sec":1.723},{"id":"game.win.01","moment":"game.win","text":"That's the game! You won the run!","off":1078584,"len":11686,"sec":1.545},{"id":"game.win.02","moment":"game.win","text":"Winner. The city goes to bed happy.","off":1090270,"len":14155,"sec":2.106},{"id":"game.win.03","moment":"game.win","text":"Game-winner. Smooth to the very end.","off":1104425,"len":13390,"sec":1.936},{"id":"game.win.04","moment":"game.win","text":"Ballgame. Other side can catch the last train.","off":1117815,"len":15903,"sec":2.557},{"id":"game.loss.01","moment":"game.loss","text":"Their song tonight. Yours is still being written.","off":1133718,"len":16564,"sec":2.592},{"id":"game.loss.02","moment":"game.loss","text":"Not tonight. The roof stays open for a rematch.","off":1150282,"len":17604,"sec":2.956},{"id":"game.loss.03","moment":"game.loss","text":"Walk it off. The city's still up.","off":1167886,"len":13019,"sec":1.864},{"id":"game.draw.01","moment":"game.draw","text":"A draw. Nobody sleeps on that.","off":1180905,"len":12724,"sec":1.809},{"id":"game.draw.02","moment":"game.draw","text":"All square. Nobody goes home happy, or everybody does.","off":1193629,"len":19820,"sec":3.467},{"id":"game.assist.01","moment":"game.assist","text":"What a pass!","off":1213449,"len":8123,"sec":0.763},{"id":"game.assist.02","moment":"game.assist","text":"Dropped the dime, quietly.","off":1221572,"len":11132,"sec":1.383},{"id":"game.assist.03","moment":"game.assist","text":"Unselfish. I like that.","off":1232704,"len":11369,"sec":1.487},{"id":"game.assist.04","moment":"game.assist","text":"Perfect pitch.","off":1244073,"len":8329,"sec":0.877},{"id":"game.alleyoop.01","moment":"game.alleyoop","text":"Lob... and flush!","off":1252402,"len":10138,"sec":1.173},{"id":"game.alleyoop.02","moment":"game.alleyoop","text":"Up top! Perfect timing!","off":1262540,"len":11098,"sec":1.43},{"id":"game.alleyoop.03","moment":"game.alleyoop","text":"Alley-oop! Pure jazz!","off":1273638,"len":9975,"sec":1.234},{"id":"game.clock.01","moment":"game.clock","text":"Ten seconds. Last dance.","off":1283613,"len":12190,"sec":1.634},{"id":"game.clock.02","moment":"game.clock","text":"The song's fading. Ten seconds.","off":1295803,"len":13408,"sec":1.963},{"id":"game.clock.03","moment":"game.clock","text":"Last ten seconds, Rooftop!","off":1309211,"len":11749,"sec":1.556},{"id":"game.overdrive.01","moment":"game.overdrive","text":"Overdrive. Every instrument, in tune.","off":1320960,"len":14379,"sec":2.155},{"id":"game.overdrive.02","moment":"game.overdrive","text":"Full sync! Turn it up!","off":1335339,"len":10509,"sec":1.298},{"id":"game.overdrive.03","moment":"game.overdrive","text":"The band's all in harmony!","off":1345848,"len":10340,"sec":1.242}]}